      "writtenOn": "2020-04-23T07:27:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm, does this prevent us from doing the __builtin_available check that we will be doing? If so, no. If not, yes.\n\nWhy do you want to fallback to sdk_version in case when min_sdk_version is not set? Can\u0027t we just set min_sdk_version anyway?",
